.IX Title "YaraFFI::Record::YR_MATCH 3pm"
.TH YaraFFI::Record::YR_MATCH 3pm 2025-10-30 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
YaraFFI::Record::YR_MATCH \- FFI Record for YARA match structure
.SH VERSION
.IX Header "VERSION"
Version 0.07
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 1
\&    use YaraFFI::Record::YR_MATCH;
\&
\&    # Cast match pointer to record
\&    my $match = $ffi\->cast(\*(Aqopaque\*(Aq, \*(Aqrecord(YaraFFI::Record::YR_MATCH)*\*(Aq, $match_ptr);
\&
\&    # Access match details
\&    my $offset = $match\->offset;
\&    my $length = $match\->match_length;
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Represents the YR_MATCH structure from YARA's libyara. Contains information
about where a string pattern matched in the scanned data.
.SH "STRUCTURE FIELDS"
.IX Header "STRUCTURE FIELDS"
.IP "base (sint64)" 4
.IX Item "base (sint64)"
Base offset
.IP "offset (sint64)" 4
.IX Item "offset (sint64)"
Byte offset where the match occurred
.IP "match_length (sint32)" 4
.IX Item "match_length (sint32)"
Length of the matched data
.IP "data_length (sint32)" 4
.IX Item "data_length (sint32)"
Length of additional data
